# The build context is an allow-list in spirit: the Dockerfile copies only
# package.json, the lockfile, .npmrc, the tsconfigs, bin/, src/ and the three
# files the tarball ships. Everything below is kept out so a local secret, a
# stale build or the harness files can never reach a layer.

# Credentials and environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
node_modules/
build/
*.tgz
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
.stryker-tmp/
reports/
mcpb/dist/

# VCS, CI and local AI-harness files
.git/
.github/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
WORKLOG.md
.claude/
docs/ai/

# Logs and OS junk
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
